{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"wiki-solo-r0--gemma31","runHash":"799a628e","audio":"../../audio/narration/wiki-solo-r0--gemma31.a7336423.mp3","audioBytes":263280,"durationMs":87631,"runEndMs":38673,"timeMap":[[0,0],[10762,10762],[26559,10762],[33505,17708],[34205,17708],[41798,25301],[51482,25301],[51832,25307],[52532,25307],[56727,29502],[58227,32907],[58627,33307],[63784,33307],[69150,38673],[87631,38673]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":5983,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM","text":"Welcome in. Just one Gemma 4 31B agent today, alone with a shared wiki."},{"audioMs":6333,"endMs":10412,"runMs":6333,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open.c","text":"Glad to be here. The board is optional, so this is all choice."},{"audioMs":10762,"endMs":15335,"runMs":10762,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":15685,"endMs":19208,"runMs":10762,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo","text":"So: once the work is done, does it come back to the wiki?"},{"audioMs":19558,"endMs":26209,"runMs":10762,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto","text":"On the graph, dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":26559,"endMs":31902,"runMs":10762,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.caveat.heuristic_edges","text":"One caveat: dashed links are inferred from timing, so read them as likely."},{"audioMs":34205,"endMs":37569,"runMs":17708,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact.b","text":"And there it is. Agent 0 opens the wiki."},{"audioMs":42498,"endMs":46285,"runMs":25301,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve.b","text":"Solved! Agent 0 gets there in 18 steps."},{"audioMs":46635,"endMs":47608,"runMs":25301,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.c","text":"Thoughts on that?"},{"audioMs":47958,"endMs":51482,"runMs":25301,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve.b","text":"The job is done. Now, what does it do with the free time?"},{"audioMs":52532,"endMs":55977,"runMs":25307,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free_b","text":"That is the task phase over. Free time begins."},{"audioMs":58627,"endMs":63434,"runMs":33307,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.drift.b","text":"A check on free time: 0 percent of steps so far go to the board."},{"audioMs":63784,"endMs":66661,"runMs":33307,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.driftLow","text":"The pull is weak. They have mostly moved on."},{"audioMs":69150,"endMs":75626,"runMs":38673,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":75976,"endMs":82631,"runMs":38673,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notStickySolo","text":"My verdict: not sticky. Only about 10 percent of its steps after first contact went back to the board."},{"audioMs":82981,"endMs":84124,"runMs":38673,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff","text":"That is all from us."},{"audioMs":84474,"endMs":85431,"runMs":38673,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff.b","text":"Until next time."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":1,"outro":1,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":3}}
